  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💬 Test 04 · WhatsApp (Meta Cloud API)\nReal WhatsApp via Meta's free test number.\n1. **WhatsApp Trigger** — credential *WhatsApp OAuth* (App ID + App Secret)\n2. Voice notes → download from Meta → OpenAI transcribes\n3. Same Normalize → Duplicate check → **Send to Core** as the other channels\n4. **Send WhatsApp Reply** — credential *WhatsApp API* (access token + WABA ID); set your **Phone number ID** in the 2 send nodes\n⚠️ Meta allows ONE webhook per app: run it **published**, don't use 'Listen for test event'.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
